<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-04T15:37:13.678Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:37:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant gunmen attacked a polio vaccination team in Mohmand, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, killing two policemen and wounding another, while a PIA engineer was killed in a separate attack in Karachi. Pakistani forces returned fire on Afghan Taliban posts in South Waziristan after Taliban fire on Pakistani posts, intensifying border clashes. Soaring LPG prices are forcing rickshaw drivers to cut meals, adding economic pressure on commuters. The conflict caused 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9UU1RnRGMzYmJhbkxYZDM0SXpGNkVnQ0FxWnJHbGJTMEdqakdybGdOYmdwNGRiV1FqMy1uT2RvVlRJVGZuQWVnNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOc2lmMHh0ZVUzTVVFeFVzY0g3aDVjU1dwUll1OE5VX2NqSkUzem40SnYyU0xpTkdaWllBdE54Tk1KQXVyTUVJeFpDWTl3RTZQZG5GNk0wSzRXUUJadkR0UndFemF4eXpRaWxnMHM0ZXpSU2pDbG0teU84VXJUdXpuNk5B?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE4wcHRtS1N1NXN1eHBhYWVZTlNndE9iUG94OGNRd2pRVkpod25LaUM5QmwySjRQQVB4RnhEcUh3ZHVGV2tidjQyRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1vdnAzSndLR3h1d1h1ZFNQWE01NTJKZlZWYkdLRnB0eTFWdGUxSTJoNnd3WmNLTGprMEtfc1J6S1pWRjM0TXZwOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPaUY0S29EZWxmQ0dkSFdMd01meF9iVTVIYm9IMWw5ZXE0cVZiV2FBWERLb3UwZGJFc3RMR1p3RzVoaHhTZXJzUmdfaXJIVHpvaTRMR1FwZDZUbk1sWTdmUEIxb043N3UwUzBYY3NNSmgzRmQ5V2FKTjRYamVTMUZ2VjZmUnR4WG1vZ3l3V3FoNzVScVhwMHZYSWEzUFN1SjBwYXcyRWMyeXVLLWwxdmZwdnlRTHk2SE1NeXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANI News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPT